<h3 class='post-title entry-title' itemprop='name'>
棋士資訊-蕭睿杉初段
</h3>
<div class='post-header'>
<div class='post-header-line-1'></div>
</div>
<div class='post-body entry-content' id='post-body-3232631111099533386' itemprop='description articleBody'>
<p>&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p><a name="more"></a><p></p><p><a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiz3uQc-yAogc3xtgUqFBAAyhnRjdOmCUylHLgl2TtoyTlGL-tyorDoIyU5EM5kfufFS_6Zey3gXrh1LSqJPA_PIF3-iID9SzuGWFJl3wk_ahOQ1rYqHxHw_hMS772juO258EgMCYUWjrs/s1600/%25E6%25A3%258B%25E5%25A3%25AB%25E8%25B3%2587%25E8%25A8%258A%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581.jpg" style="clear: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;"><img border="0" data-original-height="200" data-original-width="1400" height="56" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiz3uQc-yAogc3xtgUqFBAAyhnRjdOmCUylHLgl2TtoyTlGL-tyorDoIyU5EM5kfufFS_6Zey3gXrh1LSqJPA_PIF3-iID9SzuGWFJl3wk_ahOQ1rYqHxHw_hMS772juO258EgMCYUWjrs/s400/%25E6%25A3%258B%25E5%25A3%25AB%25E8%25B3%2587%25E8%25A8%258A%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581.jpg" width="520" /></a></p><div style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #996600; font-size: x-large;"><b><div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"><a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg_MPmy2bAbko8ZFgp-erKYeAZj9PaaEluDcH3AakClWHADV_lGr1dX2hBiignvZbJHYvb5yi0RRpN-BIv1Dm7YyMNnCtAgtMfVU7CFkCQm_3kXsKijxCtk5oNZ3znB9FZdhxcR5SX9zftF10ExebaCg50g5LdTMsZMuSmC8C3Qz-igC_bj_0cMvy8A=s3010" style="clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" data-original-height="3010" data-original-width="2690" height="200" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg_MPmy2bAbko8ZFgp-erKYeAZj9PaaEluDcH3AakClWHADV_lGr1dX2hBiignvZbJHYvb5yi0RRpN-BIv1Dm7YyMNnCtAgtMfVU7CFkCQm_3kXsKijxCtk5oNZ3znB9FZdhxcR5SX9zftF10ExebaCg50g5LdTMsZMuSmC8C3Qz-igC_bj_0cMvy8A=w179-h200" width="179" /></a></div><br />蕭睿杉初段</b></span><br /><span style="font-family: inherit;"><span style="text-align: start;">英文名:&nbsp;</span><span face="標楷體" lang="EN-US" style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;">Wesley Hsiao</span><br /><span style="text-align: start;">生&#12288;日:</span><span face="標楷體" lang="EN-US" style="text-align: left;">2010</span><span face="標楷體" style="text-align: left;">年<span lang="EN-US">8</span>月<span lang="EN-US">5</span>日</span></span></div><div style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: inherit;"><span style="text-align: start;">住&#12288;址: 台北市羅斯福路三段28號8樓</span><br /><span style="text-align: start;">類&#12288;型: 臺灣</span></span></div><div style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; text-align: start;"><br /></span></div><div style="text-align: justify;"><br /></div><div style="text-align: justify;"><br /></div><div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"><a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixnE0dNtneCfzG5T-zCDQMBt0Oob-Q7YnLVXVy7ycEpXYviHerzcPNA0ciGlQp2KCnXEBoezbCL8d0kdDXLEaeoFp5iEbe7qvaVut_UZHaw-Q3U5aaBX0rg4eIVxOQeoaZz76PySdGlYI/s1600/%25E9%2582%258A%25E7%25B7%259A.png" style="clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" data-original-height="17" data-original-width="1046" height="3" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixnE0dNtneCfzG5T-zCDQMBt0Oob-Q7YnLVXVy7ycEpXYviHerzcPNA0ciGlQp2KCnXEBoezbCL8d0kdDXLEaeoFp5iEbe7qvaVut_UZHaw-Q3U5aaBX0rg4eIVxOQeoaZz76PySdGlYI/s640/%25E9%2582%258A%25E7%25B7%259A.png" width="520" /></a></div><div style="text-align: justify;"><br /><br /><span style="text-align: start;"><span style="color: #783f04; font-size: large;"><b>簡介</b></span></span><br /><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span face="標楷體" style="font-family: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;">自五歲半始習棋&#65292;受名人棋院永春分院之翁天亮及陳紹翔老師啟蒙&#65307;升初段後跟隨林聖賢及劉耀文老師鑽研棋道&#65292;並短暫接受多位職業及業餘老師指導&#12290;此外&#65292;仁愛國小圍棋校隊之諸位教練亦予其諸多鼓勵及教誨&#12290;<span lang="EN-US">2019</span>年進入海峰圍棋道場訓練&#65292;接受周俊勳&#12289;黃祥任&#12289;劉耀文及夏大銘等諸位職業棋士指導&#12290;<span lang="EN-US">2021</span>年<span lang="EN-US">7</span>月於院生組職棋甄選定段&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span face="標楷體" style="font-family: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;">2022年1月1日晉升職業初段</span></p><span style="font-size: 14px; text-align: start;"><a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixnE0dNtneCfzG5T-zCDQMBt0Oob-Q7YnLVXVy7ycEpXYviHerzcPNA0ciGlQp2KCnXEBoezbCL8d0kdDXLEaeoFp5iEbe7qvaVut_UZHaw-Q3U5aaBX0rg4eIVxOQeoaZz76PySdGlYI/s1600/%25E9%2582%258A%25E7%25B7%259A.png" style="clear: left; font-size: medium; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;"><img border="0" data-original-height="17" data-original-width="1046" height="3" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixnE0dNtneCfzG5T-zCDQMBt0Oob-Q7YnLVXVy7ycEpXYviHerzcPNA0ciGlQp2KCnXEBoezbCL8d0kdDXLEaeoFp5iEbe7qvaVut_UZHaw-Q3U5aaBX0rg4eIVxOQeoaZz76PySdGlYI/s640/%25E9%2582%258A%25E7%25B7%259A.png" width="520" /></a></span><br /><br /><b style="color: #783f04;"><span style="font-size: large;">主要戰績</span></b><br /><span style="text-align: start;"><b>&#12298;業餘&#12299;</b></span><br /><div><p class="MsoNormal"><span face="標楷體" lang="EN-US" style="font-family: inherit; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;">2020</span><span face="標楷體" style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: inherit;">年<span lang="EN-US">:<br />
</span>韓國日曜報紙盃季軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
</span>中等以下學校圍棋運動錦標賽國小男子組冠軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
</span>第十五屆榮三盃全國學生棋王賽小學組亞軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
</span>第七屆大成盃全國圍棋棋聖賽高段組冠軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
</span>高雄市第十六屆中山盃全國圍棋錦標賽六段組冠軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
2021</span>年<span lang="EN-US">:<br />
</span>中等以下學校圍棋運動錦標賽國小男子組冠軍&#12290;<span lang="EN-US"><br />
</span>高雄市第十一屆體育盃全國圍棋錦標賽六段組冠軍</span><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: inherit;"><br /></span>
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br />
<!--[endif]--></span></span></p></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><span style="text-align: start;"><b>&#12298;職業&#12299;</b></span></div>
<div style='clear: both;'></div>
</div>
